# Resilient Roadrunner, "protection from Coyotes" (CR 702.16b, 702.16f): Bot2's Driftgloom Coyote (an Elemental Coyote) enters and its "exile target creature an opponent controls" may not
# target the Roadrunner, a creature of Bot1's, so with the Memnite (the control) the only legal target, no target is asked for and the Memnite is exiled (its power 1, so the Coyote gets
# a +1/+1 counter). On turn 3 the Roadrunner attacks: the Coyote may not block it, though Ornithopter, colorless and no Coyote, may (the control) and is killed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Memnite
Resilient Roadrunner
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Sol Ring
Driftgloom Coyote
Ornithopter
Island x16

